{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"北角貨車撞女途人　昏迷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-NP-261104-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】北角晚上有貨車撞到女途人昏迷送院。</p><p>涉事貨車車頭損毀，司機在場協助調查。晚上10時許，該食環署外判清潔承辦商貨車沿英皇道東行左轉入書局街，撞到一名女子，她受傷昏迷，由救護車送到東區醫院。意外原因有待調查。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T16:45:49.838149+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:28:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:43.439930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:52.586360+00:00","content_hash":"22ca6eebc8afc00078ed07f27b486fe8251263a7a9e787a3462485579089af74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}